    <summary>Live network upload and download speed on your Windows taskbar.</summary>
    <description>NetSpeed Boss shows your real-time download and upload speed on the Windows taskbar, next to the clock.

### Features
- **Taskbar speed meter** that blends into Windows light and dark mode and hides for full-screen apps
- **Live speed graph** with top downloading apps, peak speed, and session totals
- **Per-app network view** showing active programs, speeds, and remote hosts
- **Data usage history** for daily, monthly, and custom date ranges with CSV export in Documents and optional monthly data cap alerts
- **Floating always-on-top mini meter** with edge snapping and optional click-through mode
- **Lightweight and private** native Windows app (~120 KB) with no account, telemetry, or administrator rights required</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/merchanthasan2/NetSpeedBoss/releases/tag/v1.1.1</releaseNotes>
